{"ticker":"DLTR","updated":"2026-10-23T22:52:31Z","profile":{"longName":"Dollar Tree, Inc.","shortName":"Dollar Tree, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Discount Stores","country":"United States","website":"https://www.dollartree.com","fullTimeEmployees":150000,"marketCap":23511953408,"trailingPE":15.263093,"forwardPE":15.842032,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.1715733,"pegRatio":1.33,"targetMeanPrice":135.38461,"targetHighPrice":170.0,"targetLowPrice":98.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.07,"earningsGrowth":1.972,"grossMargins":0.3718,"operatingMargins":0.062090002,"profitMargins":0.08035,"totalRevenue":20068700160,"beta":0.716,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":142.4,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":85.88,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Dollar Tree, Inc. operates retail discount stores under the Dollar Tree and Dollar Tree Canada brands in the United States and Canada. The company offers consumable merchandise comprising everyday consumables, such as household paper and chemicals, food, candy, health, personal care products, and frozen and refrigerated food; variety merchandise consisting of toys, durable housewares, gifts, stationery, party goods, greeting cards, softlines, arts and crafts supplies, and other items; and seasonal goods, including Christmas, Easter, Halloween, and Valentine's Day merchandise. The company was founded in 1986 and is based in Chesapeake, Virginia.","summary_zh":"Dollar Tree, Inc. 在美國和加拿大以 Dollar Tree 和 Dollar Tree Canada 品牌經營零售折扣店。該公司提供消費品，包括日常消耗品，如生活用紙和化學品、食品、糖果、健康、個人護理產品以及冷凍和冷藏食品；各種商品，包括玩具、耐用家庭用品、禮品、文具、派對用品、賀卡、紡織品、工藝美術用品和其他物品；以及季節性商品，包括聖誕節、復活節、萬聖節和情人節商品。該公司成立於 1986 年，總部位於維吉尼亞州切薩皮克。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"折扣店","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":113.54,"h":114.5,"l":111.63,"c":111.8,"v":2341400},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":112.78,"h":112.97,"l":111.2,"c":111.98,"v":3894300},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":112.13,"h":113.72,"l":111.64,"c":112.86,"v":3012000},{"t"